BLIP CHANGE.log
===============

Running log of every change, newest first, with the person who made it.
This file feeds X-POSTS.md. Every post about Blip is written from here.

RULES FOR THIS FILE (Fred, 2026-09-16, standing)
  * Every entry names the person: real name from the commit author, GitHub
    login, and their X account as a link, https://x.com/<handle>.
  * A handle is written only when it is verified: the person published it
    (GitHub twitter_username, GitHub social accounts, or their own site), OR
    the X account's name matches AND its posts tie it to Omarchy/Blip/Fred.
    Checked with `gh api users/<login>`, `gh api users/<login>/social_accounts`,
    their site, then `x user @<handle>` and `x timeline @<handle>`.
  * No verified handle: write "X: none found (checked YYYY-MM-DD)" so the
    lookup is visibly done, never silently skipped, AND ASK FRED EARLY (Fred,
    standing, 2026-09-18: "Always pair the X account, ask me early if you cant
    figure out who they are"). Ask when the gap appears, at merge time, not on
    the day the post is due. He often knows the person or can ask them.
  * Add the entry in the SAME change that merges the work.

