                 write; touchpads never animate. The PR shipped it ON by default behind a shell.json setting and rewrote the
                 "never animate wheel scroll" invariant; Fred chose opt-in, default OFF, bridge.conf key: the invariant came from
                 his MX Master, whose one click is four notches, and Guido tested on a plain wheel plus an offscreen harness
                 only. Default flips on Fred's hand, not on a harness. Merged with the change, 632 tests, deployed key-absent.
                 Guido Jouret, github.com/gjouret, X https://x.com/gjouret
